Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 12:40:25 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] design: keep the terminal Copy button above the code it
 floats over

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011CH6tKeE4iJ874reAvf4rR
---
 packages/design/css/base.css | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/packages/design/css/base.css b/packages/design/css/base.css
index 4957537..e987512 100644
--- a/packages/design/css/base.css
+++ b/packages/design/css/base.css
@@ -412,8 +412,11 @@
 .yk-code .tok-prompt {
     user-select: none;
 }
+/* Above the code whatever the markup order: highlighters give each line position: relative, and a button placed
+   before the <pre> was painted over, so hovering its icon hovered a line of code instead (docs, 2026-11-13). */
 .yk-code--terminal > .yk-icon-btn {
     position: absolute;
+    z-index: 1;
     top: 6px;
     right: 6px;
     opacity: 0;
-- 
